{"id": "94810016", "name": "מד\"ר ברנולי – ההצבה v = y^m והמד\"ר הלינארית שמתקבלת (בלי לפתור)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מד\"ר ברנולי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>ההצבה</div><p>מצאו את המעריך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m\\)</span> שעבורו ההצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=y^m\\)</span> הופכת את המד\"ר למד\"ר לינארית עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v(x)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(m=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>המד\"ר הלינארית</div><p>אחרי ההצבה מתקבלת מד\"ר לינארית מהצורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'+P(x)\\,v=Q(x)\\)</span>. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Q(x)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(P(x)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(Q(x)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> סעיף א׳ — שלבים 1–2: מחלקים בחזקה של y ומזהים את ההצבה. סעיף ב׳ — שלב 3: מציבים ומנרמלים את המקדם של v′.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — זיהוי וחלוקה</b><br>זו מד\"ר ברנולי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'+p(x)\\,y=q(x)\\,y^n\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:1}}\\)</span>. מחלקים את שני האגפים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span>, כלומר מכפילים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — ההצבה</b><br>באגף שמאל מופיעה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>, ולכן מציבים<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ v=y^{{{CT:6}}},\\qquad m=1-n={{CT:6}} \\]</p>לפי כלל השרשרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:8}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — המד\"ר הלינארית</b><br>מציבים במשוואה משלב 1 ומכפילים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\)</span>, כדי שהמקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'\\)</span> יהיה 1:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ v'+\\left({{CT:9}}\\right)v={{CT:10}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P(x)={{CT:9}},\\qquad Q(x)={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>[[feedback:prt2]]</p><p>[[feedback:prt3]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה, יפה מאוד!</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span class=\"partially\">תשובה חלקית</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span class=\"incorrect\">תשובה שגויה</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "m", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "nm", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T sign", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> בדקו את הסימן: במד\"ר ברנולי עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y^n\\)</span> באגף ימין ההצבה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=y^{1-n}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "n", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T n", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> זה המעריך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> שבמד\"ר; ההצבה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=y^{1-n}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> במד\"ר ברנולי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'+p(x)\\,y=q(x)\\,y^n\\)</span> מחלקים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y^n\\)</span>, וההצבה המתאימה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=y^{1-n}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "P", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "p", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T no factor", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> שגוי. חסר הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-n\\)</span>: מאחר ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'=(1-n)\\,y^{-n}\\,y'\\)</span>, צריך להכפיל את כל המשוואה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-n\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> שגוי. חלקו את המד\"ר ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y^n\\)</span>, הציבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=y^{1-n}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'=(1-n)\\,y^{-n}\\,y'\\)</span>, והכפילו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-n\\)</span> כדי שהמקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'\\)</span> יהיה 1.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "Q", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Q(x)\\)</span> נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "q", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-T no factor", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Q(x)\\)</span> שגוי. חסר הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-n\\)</span>: מאחר ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'=(1-n)\\,y^{-n}\\,y'\\)</span>, צריך להכפיל את כל המשוואה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-n\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Q(x)\\)</span> שגוי. חלקו את המד\"ר ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y^n\\)</span>, הציבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=y^{1-n}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'=(1-n)\\,y^{-n}\\,y'\\)</span>, והכפילו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-n\\)</span> כדי שהמקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'\\)</span> יהיה 1.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["P", "Q", "a", "b", "ch1", "ch2", "m", "mn", "n", "nm", "ode", "ode1", "p", "pt", "q", "qt", "ym", "ymn", "y